Does the demon kill you? That is not necessary. First discover the complete
level, then go to the fountain and write the 'E'-word (and check this). Then
do something with the fountain (quaff or dip). If you get an evil demon just
go to the next level. This will succeed because you wrote the 'E'-word, demons
are not faster then you and demons are not so strong that you can't survive
some hits. The only thing you should not do is to try to kill the demon. This
will fail and when you realize, you have no spare hitpoints to reach the
stairs.

